        spanning every subspace of `fespace`. `model` is `"plane_stress"` /
        `"plane_strain"` (2-D) or `"solid"` (3-D). Same DOFs as elasticity
        (`u_x, u_y(, u_z)`); material (`E`, `nu`, `sigma_y`) is supplied at
